{"id":"770cd219aa417801","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-model6-complete-type.md","title":"ZFC Model6 Complete Type","display":"df-zfc-model6-complete-type — ZFC Model6 Complete Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model6-complete-type","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model6-complete-type"],"display":"df-zfc-model6-complete-type — ZFC Model6 Complete Type","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model6-complete-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model6-complete-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model6-complete-type — ZFC Model6 Complete Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_A,A,c,p,n\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L_A,A,c,p,n\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:A\\to\\mathcal L_A.\\mathrm{Cst}\">\\(c:A\\to\\mathcal L_A.\\mathrm{Cst}\\)</span> is the explicit naming map for parameters</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A)\\)</span> is defined below using <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_A}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> are as in the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}\\)</span> is the constant-symbol interpretation component of a structure</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteType}_S\\)</span> is the five-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type\\text{-}formulas} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_A):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_A}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type\\text{-}formulas} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_A):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_A}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteType}_S(p,\\mathcal L_A,A,c,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land c:A\\to\\mathcal L_A.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_A)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c(a))=a)\\land p=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteType}_S(p,\\mathcal L_A,A,c,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land c:A\\to\\mathcal L_A.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_A)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c(a))=a)\\land p=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The expanded language and its parameter-naming map are explicit; the interpretation of each name <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(a)\">\\(c(a)\\)</span> is required to be <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A realizing assignment determines a consistent complete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-type without using an unbound satisfaction notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_A,A,c,p,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c:A\\to\\mathcal L_A.\\mathrm{Cst}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type\\text{-}formulas} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_A):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_A}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i<n\\}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteType}_S(p,\\mathcal L_A,A,c,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land c:A\\to\\mathcal L_A.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_A)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c(a))=a)\\land p=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L_A):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2217,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2761","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zf